{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"be7513585a3d369ebe5668f05e06a2f264aeb2c62f5d394973909645f0578b53","ja":"名探偵（？）の推理","zh":"名侦探（？）的推理","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:15+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b4c7ad473797ac8ddc33046f2f84cfd5f336955a1ae6aa68076760f3e0a77ff5","ja":"うーん、やっぱりないね～。","zh":"嗯——果然没有呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"644a9790b396306637c7d629be04157c8a2182778eebdcc90f4f0d48544608c3","ja":"ごめんね、冷蔵庫の中身を移したこと、\nみんなに伝えておくべきだったよ。","zh":"对不起，我应该提前跟大家说一声，\n冰箱里的东西被移走了的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"49e3f81752543ee6fe8f560574d84d43ca18341094efcea0f7b2699043b993ed","ja":"ううん、優しさは伝わってるから！\n茜ちゃんチョコが大事にされたってことだよね！","zh":"不会，这份心意已经传达到了！\n说明小茜巧克力有被好好珍惜对吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:22:44+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"bfbab71ba64d243bba65585f5f4be2a53d961ec5543f0b46d69ff7ede770ea61","ja":"その気持ちに応えるためにも見つけないと！\n名探偵茜ちゃんに任せて！　謎は必ず解いてみせる！","zh":"为了回应这份心意，也必须找到才行！\n就交给名侦探小茜吧！谜团我一定会解开的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"c768f8fb5d56070ecc6bad7cb362e23f00c085d5db81ad8b568dd4e950e7d3e5","ja":"うん、頑張ろう！　……えっと、メモの付いた\n箱だよね？　たしか、緑色の……。","zh":"嗯，加油吧！……那个，是贴着便签的\n箱子对吧？我记得是绿色的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"727021e40806754fe10a35330985e72e88a5d8c4a046f13ffa9073e83314a9a6","ja":"えっ、ちょっと待って！？\n緑色？　赤じゃなくて？","zh":"哎，等等！？\n绿色？不是红色吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"92a7e139987cb9c7354b66ee48bc2399ffa73639f0f51ce46fb5791ac91cade4","ja":"うん。……あれ？　そこにあるのは、\n違うのかな……？　ほら、冷蔵庫の2段目。","zh":"嗯。……咦？放在那里的，\n不是吗……？你看，冰箱的第2层。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"d4a9885984cb8b3e4f77ba82fd14d4c36c9a5786adc91367961787f79b98d91f","ja":"あっ！　そういえば、赤い箱が壊れたから、\n美咲ちゃんに緑の箱をもらったんだった！","zh":"啊！说起来，因为红色的箱子坏了，\n所以我从美咲那里拿到了绿色的箱子！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"533822582d717eeb6d3f62f533a5bf1934a537b39f829fdf3cb95baf73c9313c","ja":"なるほどね……ふっふっふっ。\nわかったよ！","zh":"原来如此啊……哼哼哼。\n我明白了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d321b7119ee8acee9bcfcbd227d93d6bc8360cac88a829e40c7d58f2bfd8f533","ja":"この事件の犯人！\nずばり、それは……！","zh":"这起案件的犯人！\n一言蔽之，那就是……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d33884f4442332877b5c73756f27d135674206111deeaac576a7b5e1674e3e44","ja":"そ、それは……！？","zh":"那、那是……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f38c49186c9fa092c854b5977282e84617b36a35e6a6d8e524d3e055a929a3c1","ja":"箱を入れ替えてたことを忘れてた\n茜ちゃんです……。","zh":"忘了之前把箱子掉包了的\n小茜是也……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1f70d17b6a4dded3a4468821a6a0dc72462be3ff3c717ae8a4991882d17a0dd0","ja":"あ、あはは……そうだったんだ……。\nみ、見つかってよかったね、茜ちゃん！","zh":"啊、啊哈哈……原来是这样啊……\n能、能找到真是太好了呢，小茜！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6a3124839df013d1550a5c6bc82103786fbac7bb80918431aad6a0f421ebc1b0","ja":"そうそう。あれ、でもメモはどうしたのかな？\n……あっ。茜、袖に何かついてるよ。","zh":"对对。哎，不过备忘纸跑哪去了呢？\n……啊。茜，你的袖子上沾着什么东西哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7b3fa360a1d6b4ba4102bc9fc28f675d1a47e5ef1e4f9513f2624f5771966413","ja":"…………「食べちゃダメだよ！」……！\nこれは間違いなく、茜ちゃんが書いたメモ……！","zh":"…………“不许吃哦！”……！\n这肯定是小茜留的便签……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"dd2cbae98e65f159b9d8bb3988f8d57be69a800f341e6afcc190d96dde7087bf","ja":"最初に冷蔵庫を探した時に、\nくっついちゃったみたい……。","zh":"第一次找冰箱的时候，\n好像粘上去了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1001.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"fdc49dd3be092adca19f16fad4d45f449bfe7104b740dc8724755616bab45b3f","ja":"お、大騒ぎしてごめんニャさ～い。\n『手のひら茜ちゃんチョコ』あげるから許して～！","zh":"大、大吵大闹的真是对不起喵～\n我把“掌心小茜巧克力”送给你，就原谅我吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:01:31+00:00"}
